  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f2wMZKZ7B6E\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/735938861636780042?style=flat-square&amp;logo=discord&amp;label=Discord&amp;color=5865F2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> • <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcozary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support-Ko--fi-F16061?style=flat-square&amp;logo=ko-fi&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a> • <a href=\"https://github.com/Cozary/Nameless-Trinkets/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Cozary/Nameless-Trinkets?style=flat-square&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white&amp;color=364763\" alt=\"Issues\"></a> • <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fnameless-trinkets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://badges.crowdin.net/nameless-trinkets/localized.svg\" alt=\"Crowdin\"></a></p><h2><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1lib5AY.png\" alt=\"\"></h2><h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>关于</strong></span></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">正在寻找一款能添加强大饰品的模组？本模组为游戏引入了各式各样的饰品，每一件都拥有独特的能力，其效果将根据具体情境或你的游玩方式而有所不同。</span></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FHlewK2.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>探索世界时，你可以在结构生成的宝箱中找到这些饰品！或者你也可以亲手制作它们！</em></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media0.giphy.com/media/M6fEiWDG1m1Mjgpri4/giphy.gif\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">按住Shift键查看物品，即可了解饰品提供的能力。游戏中至少有25种以上拥有独特能力的饰品！还在等什么，快去收集齐全吧？</span></p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OT2aoh8.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hr7S7mp.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>部分饰品的设计灵感来源于经典游戏《以撒的结合》。这源于我之前的一个项目，当时我希望将这款游戏中的饰品引入到模组中。</em></span></p>",
